      "writtenOn": "2022-10-26T01:23:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know we use have relaxed checks for the imported modules, but I think the right way to do this is to add the different `cc_api_variant` modules as deps in the depsmutator.\n\nThen in `link`, use ctx.VisitDirectDeps to pick the right one. The benefits are\n1. We get more robust module checking during Soong analysis, as opposed to string based matching\n2. The dependency graph will be accurately reflected in build analysis tools",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 104,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 109,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "c19d7ae91861b2084af1c4f62f0bcab732151d03",
